{"id":"1f93d12a38d07e25","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings.md","title":"Strong Cardinal Embeddings","display":"thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings — Strong Cardinal Embeddings","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings","aliases":["58-thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings","Strong Cardinal Embeddings","Strongness Characterization"],"display":"thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings — Strong Cardinal Embeddings","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-large-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings</span><span>Strong Cardinal Embeddings</span><span>Strongness Characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strong-cardinal-embeddings — Strong Cardinal Embeddings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66e7bdc463325f8b\" href=\"?note=66e7bdc463325f8b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-strong.md\">../batch15/58-df-strong.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"180e55a5516174c6\" href=\"?note=180e55a5516174c6\" title=\"58-df-large-embedding\">58-df-large-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> range over class parameters in the ambient class metatheory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strong}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{LargeEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Strong}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{LargeEmbedding}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span> denotes existential quantification in the ambient class metatheory.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embeddings} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\n\\left(\n\\kappa\\in\\lambda\n\\to\n\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}M\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}j\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{LargeEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,M)\n\\land\\lambda\\in j(\\kappa)\n\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}embeddings} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\n\\left(\n\\kappa\\in\\lambda\n\\to\n\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}M\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{class}}j\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{LargeEmbedding}_S(j,\\kappa,M)\n\\land\\lambda\\in j(\\kappa)\n\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong: via embeddings with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda \\subseteq M\">\\(V_\\lambda \\subseteq M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Intermediate: measurable &lt; strong &lt; supercompact.</li>\n<li>The notion refines into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-strong variants indexed by the captured rank segment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The target model closure is the core distinction between measurability and strongness.</li>\n<li>The witnesses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> are class objects. They are not quantified as members of the set universe or fed to a set-structure embedding predicate.</li>\n<li>Applications: inner model theory.</li>\n<li>Reflection: strong reflection properties.</li>\n<li>Used in: determinacy proofs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-strong.md","status":"resolved","id":"66e7bdc463325f8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4"